  abstract={The preparation of interviews has been important more than ever for graduates stepping into competitive job markets. However, many students miss out on structured and interactive platforms to practice these essential soft skills while These are their academic years. We introduce an AI-powered mock interview platform to bridge this gap in an interactive and Intelligent environment for interview preparation. The system uses a virtual interviewer for real-time interview scenarios. while analyzing candidate responses through facial expressions. voice tone, speaking pace, and body language. It merges techniques from facial expression recognition, speech processing, behavioral analysis to enable relevant and timely feedback. Through visual feedback, users can review their performance. dashboards and track improvements between sessions. Additional modules assess grammar through speech-to-text conversion and Provide a thorough assessment of communication effectiveness. What sets this work apart is the holistic approach it brings to training. Merging artificial intelligence with behavioral insights to create a dynamic learning tool, in that it simulates real interviews and The platform aids users in improving not by offering instant feedback. not only their responses but also how they cast those responses. This research It highlights how Artificial Intelligence can be used to create Confidence, communication skills, and better preparation. people for real-world professional opportunities},
